          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“And now, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " God, fulfil for all time the promise you made about me and my descendants, and do what you said you would. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your fame will be great, and people will for ever say, ‘The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty is God over Israel.’ And you will preserve my dynasty for all time. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", God of Israel! I have the courage to pray this prayer to you, because you have revealed all this to me, your servant, and have told me that you will make my descendants kings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
